1
00:00:08,103 --> 00:00:10,522
<font color="white">-好耶！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好耶！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:14,776
<font color="white">-今天你出手闊綽耶</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-因為有一些臨時收入</font></font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:16,069
<font color="white">算是副業吧</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:16,153 --> 00:00:19,489
<font color="white">你幹了那麼見不得光的勾當啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:19,573 --> 00:00:20,949
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:22,451
<font color="white">我不能透漏太多</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:22,534 --> 00:00:26,955
<font color="white">總之是藉助最近人氣下滑的英雄得利</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:30,500
<font color="white">-哇，喂！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-那些報酬非常可觀啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:33,295 --> 00:00:34,546
<font color="white">關於那件事</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:36,465 --> 00:00:39,092
<font color="white">能把詳情說來聽聽嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:14,187 --> 00:02:16,273
<font color="white">那個，這是…</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:20,110 --> 00:02:22,404
<font color="white">不會吧</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:23,029 --> 00:02:26,199
<font color="white">難道妳就是第四人？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:26,283 --> 00:02:27,325
<font color="white">第四人？</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:28,201 --> 00:02:30,579
<font color="white">是你襲擊了我爸對吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:30,662 --> 00:02:33,373
<font color="white">我絕對不會原諒你的</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:33,456 --> 00:02:35,167
<font color="white">原來如此</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:35,250 --> 00:02:38,962
<font color="white">看來妳還無法隨心所欲地</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">控制那股能力</font></font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:39,045 --> 00:02:41,590
<font color="white">我該怎麼辦？</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:46,011 --> 00:02:49,014
<font color="white">我要在此立下大功了！</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:49,097 --> 00:02:50,724
<font color="white">玲奈小姐，快逃！</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:02:55,604 --> 00:02:57,772
<font color="white">你做什麼啦？</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:04,362 --> 00:03:05,322
<font color="white">真是的！</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:07,032 --> 00:03:08,158
<font color="white">不要過來！</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:08,783 --> 00:03:09,951
<font color="white">放開我啦！</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:13,079 --> 00:03:14,748
<font color="white">我都叫你住手了！</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:42,234 --> 00:03:43,944
<font color="white">好痛！可惡啊</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:48,073 --> 00:03:49,866
<font color="white">妳竟然讓我如此費勁</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:04:02,379 --> 00:04:04,172
<font color="white">挺有一套的嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:05,257 --> 00:04:06,424
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:06,508 --> 00:04:12,639
<font color="white">不過我也不能這樣就善罷甘休</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:31,491 --> 00:04:32,325
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:04:36,579 --> 00:04:39,207
<font color="white">怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:04:42,627 --> 00:04:45,630
<font color="white">扎拉比那傢伙都沒有聯絡我們</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:04:45,714 --> 00:04:47,090
<font color="white">他到底在做什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:04:47,966 --> 00:04:51,594
<font color="white">只要他可以履行自己的職責就行</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:51,678 --> 00:04:53,221
<font color="white">是喔</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:54,139 --> 00:04:57,392
<font color="white">好不容易孤立了那位超人力霸王男孩</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:57,934 --> 00:04:59,686
<font color="white">如果被他逃掉我可不管</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:59,769 --> 00:05:01,062
<font color="white">不用擔心</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:01,146 --> 00:05:04,274
<font color="white">科學特搜隊正在全力追捕他</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:04,357 --> 00:05:09,571
<font color="white">也就是說有超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">互相廝殺的可能性囉？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:10,447 --> 00:05:12,657
<font color="white">若變成那樣就太有趣了</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:13,950 --> 00:05:15,910
<font color="white">或許可以好好利用呢</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:16,494 --> 00:05:19,748
<font color="white">我可沒有義務受你指示</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:19,831 --> 00:05:22,625
<font color="white">我自會好好享受的</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:05:22,709 --> 00:05:23,918
<font color="white">再見啦</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:05:36,890 --> 00:05:40,018
<font color="white">那時超人力霸王的失控舉動…</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:41,436 --> 00:05:46,816
<font color="white">鐵定就是那徵兆</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:51,571
<font color="white">爸和玲奈小姐…</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:54,449 --> 00:05:57,619
<font color="white">但是我要怎麼聯繫上她？</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:06:01,456 --> 00:06:05,210
{\an8}<font color="white">（《我的好天氣》</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">佐山玲奈）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:06:05,293 --> 00:06:06,503
{\an8}<font color="white">（要一直保持這樣的你喔）</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:06:09,631 --> 00:06:10,632
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:06:11,633 --> 00:06:13,384
<font color="white">這些數字…</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:06:16,429 --> 00:06:18,640
<font color="white">說不定倒過來看的話…</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:06:27,107 --> 00:06:29,234
<font color="white">你好，我是玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:29,317 --> 00:06:31,236
<font color="white">-那個…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-謝謝你的來電</font></font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:06:31,986 --> 00:06:35,115
<font color="white">抱歉，我現在無法接聽電話</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:41,371 --> 00:06:42,497
<font color="white">玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:49,045 --> 00:06:51,422
<font color="white">果然是那麼一回事啊</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:52,006 --> 00:06:53,299
<font color="white">到底是怎樣？</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:06:53,383 --> 00:06:56,469
<font color="white">我突然變得像超人力霸王耶</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:06:56,553 --> 00:06:58,304
<font color="white">不只是像</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:58,805 --> 00:07:01,015
<font color="white">怎麼看都是超人力霸王啊</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:07:01,891 --> 00:07:05,311
<font color="white">不，這情況應該稱為</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">“女超人力霸王”吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:07:05,395 --> 00:07:07,147
<font color="white">怎麼稱呼都好啦</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:07:07,647 --> 00:07:09,941
<font color="white">貝姆拉為什麼會想把這個給我爸？</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:07:10,024 --> 00:07:13,695
<font color="white">爸會被襲擊和這頸鍊有關吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:07:13,778 --> 00:07:15,447
<font color="white">而且為什麼會是我？</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:07:16,364 --> 00:07:19,659
<font color="white">都不知道該從哪裡開始吐槽了</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:07:19,742 --> 00:07:21,411
<font color="white">我想也是</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:21,494 --> 00:07:23,288
<font color="white">總之請先冷靜</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:23,371 --> 00:07:25,331
<font color="white">怎麼有辦法冷靜啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:07:27,292 --> 00:07:29,294
<font color="white">為何我會遇到這種事？</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:31,546 --> 00:07:32,547
<font color="white">對了</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:33,339 --> 00:07:34,632
<font color="white">我要聯絡進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:07:34,716 --> 00:07:36,926
<font color="white">現在不能依賴學長</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:37,010 --> 00:07:38,344
<font color="white">我們找其他人吧</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:39,929 --> 00:07:40,930
<font color="white">等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:41,973 --> 00:07:44,559
<font color="white">“學長”是指進次郎對吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:44,642 --> 00:07:46,019
<font color="white">為什麼不能依賴他？</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:46,102 --> 00:07:47,270
<font color="white">妳不知道嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:47,353 --> 00:07:50,023
<font color="white">學長現在出了一些狀況</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:50,732 --> 00:07:51,941
<font color="white">進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:54,611 --> 00:07:55,862
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:56,654 --> 00:07:57,697
<font color="white">為什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:58,406 --> 00:08:00,408
<font color="white">你果然在這裡</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:08:02,744 --> 00:08:04,204
<font color="white">你在說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:08:05,288 --> 00:08:09,709
<font color="white">你也認識那個叫佐山玲奈的女孩吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:08:09,792 --> 00:08:11,711
<font color="white">一追查她就找到你了</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:08:12,921 --> 00:08:14,130
<font color="white">玲奈小姐嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:08:15,715 --> 00:08:17,217
<font color="white">你想做什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:08:17,300 --> 00:08:20,470
<font color="white">不會對她做什麼，我在追捕的是你</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:08:23,598 --> 00:08:27,101
<font color="white">現在請放我一馬</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:08:27,185 --> 00:08:29,479
<font color="white">我必須過去</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:31,231 --> 00:08:33,900
<font color="white">不能讓她捲入事件中</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:08:35,193 --> 00:08:37,111
<font color="white">我不會再讓你逃掉了</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:08:38,571 --> 00:08:41,616
<font color="white">無論用什麼方法我都要把你帶回去</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:08:49,749 --> 00:08:51,000
<font color="white">進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:09:13,856 --> 00:09:15,692
<font color="white">你覺得自己可以成功脫逃兩次嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:09:17,443 --> 00:09:19,195
<font color="white">我只是換個地方</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:09:19,279 --> 00:09:20,947
<font color="white">如果我們認真對打</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:22,949
<font color="white">會再次造成災情</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:09:24,242 --> 00:09:28,037
<font color="white">我知道你沒打算被捉住</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:09:28,913 --> 00:09:30,498
<font color="white">只能戰鬥了嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:09:35,336 --> 00:09:36,504
<font color="white">怎麼會？</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:09:36,588 --> 00:09:37,589
<font color="white">（傳送）</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:09:37,672 --> 00:09:39,591
<font color="white">難道是嵐先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:09:51,936 --> 00:09:53,563
<font color="white">傳送成功了</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:55,481 --> 00:09:57,358
<font color="white">這樣你就能使出全力了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:10:00,653 --> 00:10:01,779
<font color="white">我要上了！</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:10:05,867 --> 00:10:07,702
<font color="white">你在裡面吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:10:07,785 --> 00:10:09,829
<font color="white">我回來了，進來吧</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:10:11,748 --> 00:10:13,625
<font color="white">嗨，好久不見</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:10:15,752 --> 00:10:18,671
<font color="white">突然回來是發生了什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:10:18,755 --> 00:10:22,008
<font color="white">抱歉，在這邊有些雜事要處理</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:10:22,592 --> 00:10:25,178
<font color="white">有個麻煩的傢伙跟我一起回來</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:10:25,261 --> 00:10:26,679
<font color="white">我被耽擱所以走不開</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:10:26,763 --> 00:10:28,514
<font color="white">我有件事想立刻問你…</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:10:28,598 --> 00:10:29,974
<font color="white">等一下</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:10:30,058 --> 00:10:33,603
<font color="white">在那之前，你沒有其他要說的話嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:10:37,857 --> 00:10:38,858
<font color="white">我回來了</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:10:39,692 --> 00:10:41,903
<font color="white">好，歡迎回來</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:10:42,987 --> 00:10:44,280
<font color="white">怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:10:44,781 --> 00:10:48,660
<font color="white">我有說過對吧？這也是我的家</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:10:48,743 --> 00:10:51,245
<font color="white">他就是養育我長大的親人</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:10:52,872 --> 00:10:53,790
<font color="white">你好</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:10:53,873 --> 00:10:56,417
<font color="white">喔，是你的女朋友嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:10:56,501 --> 00:10:58,252
<font color="white">不知不覺中就長大了啊</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:10:58,336 --> 00:11:01,798
<font color="white">我們不是那種關係</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你看她脖子上的東西</font></font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:11:05,051 --> 00:11:07,553
<font color="white">喔，她就是那個女孩啊</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,975
<font color="white">確實很像</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:11:13,976 --> 00:11:15,520
<font color="white">什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:11:15,603 --> 00:11:16,437
<font color="white">話說回來</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:11:17,605 --> 00:11:19,982
<font color="white">我想知道為什麼自己</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">會變成超人力霸王</font></font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:11:20,066 --> 00:11:21,609
<font color="white">冷靜點</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:11:23,986 --> 00:11:27,073
<font color="white">她的裝甲是大叔做的吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:11:27,657 --> 00:11:30,118
<font color="white">為什麼貝姆拉會盯上她？</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:11:30,701 --> 00:11:33,037
<font color="white">不是這樣的</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:11:33,955 --> 00:11:36,874
<font color="white">不是貝姆拉盯上那女孩</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:11:38,418 --> 00:11:40,878
<font color="white">是她吸引了貝姆拉</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:11:42,046 --> 00:11:42,964
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:11:45,091 --> 00:11:47,468
<font color="white">這是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:12:07,405 --> 00:12:11,993
<font color="white">進次郎，你認真起來</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就只有那種程度嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:12:19,625 --> 00:12:21,919
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:12:25,715 --> 00:12:27,425
<font color="white">我…</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:12:29,594 --> 00:12:32,638
<font color="white">你說她吸引了貝姆拉是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:12:32,722 --> 00:12:36,267
<font color="white">貝姆拉突然來找</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">在美國的我並這麼說…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:12:37,143 --> 00:12:42,356
<font color="white">在她喚醒本來的力量前</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:12:43,691 --> 00:12:46,736
<font color="white">必須事先進行準備</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:12:48,613 --> 00:12:51,949
<font color="white">然後他叫我做出她能穿的裝甲</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:12:54,118 --> 00:12:55,953
<font color="white">這麼說來…</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:12:56,037 --> 00:12:57,705
<font color="white">這麼說來？</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:12:58,414 --> 00:13:01,459
<font color="white">你知道我身材實際上的三圍？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:13:05,213 --> 00:13:06,088
<font color="white">然後呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:13:06,172 --> 00:13:09,217
<font color="white">詳情我沒有多問</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:13:09,300 --> 00:13:12,178
<font color="white">我可不想被捲進麻煩事裡</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:13:14,055 --> 00:13:15,640
<font color="white">我很好奇</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:13:15,723 --> 00:13:16,933
<font color="white">好奇哪一點？</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:13:17,016 --> 00:13:19,769
<font color="white">我不是那個意思啦</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:13:20,436 --> 00:13:25,691
<font color="white">貝姆拉是說“在她喚醒</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">本來的力量前”對吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:13:26,275 --> 00:13:27,401
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:13:28,569 --> 00:13:33,241
<font color="white">這表示妳從最初就是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">應當成為超人力霸王的存在</font></font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:13:34,075 --> 00:13:35,201
<font color="white">什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:13:35,785 --> 00:13:38,204
<font color="white">我能說的只有這些</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:13:40,081 --> 00:13:41,499
<font color="white">遠藤玲奈小姐</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:13:42,375 --> 00:13:45,586
<font color="white">妳到底是何方神聖？</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:13:46,921 --> 00:13:49,298
<font color="white">就算你問我，我也不知道</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:13:56,305 --> 00:13:58,224
<font color="white">我知道了，我會告訴你的</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:13:58,975 --> 00:14:03,521
<font color="white">我們事前就聽說會發生</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">之前的超人力霸王事件</font></font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:14:04,564 --> 00:14:05,523
<font color="white">繼續說</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:14:06,315 --> 00:14:10,027
<font color="white">我們被要求趁此騷動時</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:14:10,111 --> 00:14:12,363
<font color="white">到嵯峨吉町住宅區肆意闖空門</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:14:12,446 --> 00:14:13,698
<font color="white">闖空門？</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:14:13,781 --> 00:14:17,660
<font color="white">不僅能輕易闖空門</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">還有額外報酬可以拿</font></font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:14:17,743 --> 00:14:19,328
<font color="white">沒有比這更好的差事了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:14:21,247 --> 00:14:24,917
<font color="white">工作內容應該不只那些吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:27,461
<font color="white">我說就是了</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:14:28,379 --> 00:14:29,839
<font color="white">還要調查關於十幾年前</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:14:29,922 --> 00:14:35,344
<font color="white">曾居住於該處的小孩的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">相關情報全都要據實回報</font></font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:14:36,387 --> 00:14:39,807
<font color="white">十幾年前的小孩的情報？</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:14:41,267 --> 00:14:42,184
<font color="white">這樣夠了吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:14:42,268 --> 00:14:44,478
<font color="white">指派那項工作給你的</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:14:45,354 --> 00:14:46,439
<font color="white">是這傢伙嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:14:48,649 --> 00:14:51,235
<font color="white">不，並非是他…</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:14:52,612 --> 00:14:56,240
<font color="white">去哪裡可以見到他？</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:14:56,324 --> 00:14:57,700
<font color="white">我會說的！</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:14:58,284 --> 00:14:59,660
<font color="white">都說了我會告訴你啦！</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:25,645
<font color="white">被滅口了嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:15:26,979 --> 00:15:28,522
<font color="white">這道傷口…</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:15:33,444 --> 00:15:36,238
<font color="white">不好了！新的超人力霸王…</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:15:41,285 --> 00:15:42,787
<font color="white">到底發生了什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:15:47,458 --> 00:15:50,086
<font color="white">看來終於找到你了</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:16:36,549 --> 00:16:39,385
<font color="white">太郎先生，已經夠了</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:16:39,468 --> 00:16:41,929
<font color="white">你的意思是我打不贏你嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:16:42,471 --> 00:16:43,973
<font color="white">不是的</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:16:44,056 --> 00:16:47,560
<font color="white">在我們打鬥的當下</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">玲奈小姐可能正陷入危險之中</font></font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:16:47,643 --> 00:16:50,521
{\an8}<font color="white">我只是想要救她！</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:16:56,235 --> 00:16:57,611
<font color="white">進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:16:58,195 --> 00:17:00,740
<font color="white">你是為了什麼成為超人力霸王的？</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:17:00,823 --> 00:17:02,867
<font color="white">對你來說超人力霸王是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:17:04,285 --> 00:17:05,953
<font color="white">為什麼要問我那些？</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:17:06,746 --> 00:17:11,625
<font color="white">那時候你努力想證明自己的清白</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:17:11,709 --> 00:17:14,837
<font color="white">這傢伙假扮成超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:17:15,379 --> 00:17:17,673
<font color="white">全都是他謀劃的詭計</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:17:18,174 --> 00:17:21,052
<font color="white">在我看來你當時</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:17:21,135 --> 00:17:23,137
<font color="white">只是一心想為早田先生報仇</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:17:23,721 --> 00:17:27,224
<font color="white">可是你現在卻說想要救某個人</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:17:27,808 --> 00:17:30,728
<font color="white">告訴我你真實的想法吧</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:17:36,358 --> 00:17:37,526
<font color="white">在逃走後</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:17:38,277 --> 00:17:39,487
<font color="white">我變成孤身一人</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:17:40,029 --> 00:17:43,324
<font color="white">我心裡想著很多人的事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">然後接受了別人的幫助</font></font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:17:45,576 --> 00:17:46,744
<font color="white">最終我意識到</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:17:47,787 --> 00:17:52,583
<font color="white">如果我步上爸一路走來的道路</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:17:53,334 --> 00:17:55,461
<font color="white">也許就會知道答案了</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:17:57,004 --> 00:18:01,383
{\an8}<font color="white">關於我應該成為什麼樣的超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:18:02,968 --> 00:18:06,430
<font color="white">所以我不能在這裡止步！</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:18:09,767 --> 00:18:11,519
<font color="white">你說得對</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:18:11,602 --> 00:18:13,729
<font color="white">這就是我希望從你口中聽到的話</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:18:25,783 --> 00:18:26,867
<font color="white">諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:18:28,077 --> 00:18:30,162
<font color="white">你把他逼到這裡了，做得很好</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:18:30,663 --> 00:18:32,248
<font color="white">接下來我會處理</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:18:33,290 --> 00:18:37,128
<font color="white">不，請讓我對付他</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:18:37,211 --> 00:18:38,712
<font color="white">好吧</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:18:41,090 --> 00:18:42,049
<font color="white">這樣的話…</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:18:42,591 --> 00:18:43,551
{\an8}<font color="white">太郎先生！</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:18:54,603 --> 00:18:56,397
<font color="white">果然是假冒的</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:18:57,898 --> 00:19:01,902
<font color="white">每次都會掉入相同的陷阱呢</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:19:06,323 --> 00:19:07,908
<font color="white">這下我明白了</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:19:08,617 --> 00:19:12,413
<font color="white">你們從一開始就計畫要將</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">進次郎逼入絕境對吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:19:13,539 --> 00:19:15,666
<font color="white">若在那場復興紀念典禮發生的事件</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:19:15,749 --> 00:19:19,170
<font color="white">如進次郎所言是假冒者所為</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:19:19,253 --> 00:19:20,880
<font color="white">一切就解釋得通了</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:19:21,881 --> 00:19:25,342
<font color="white">而且我現在親自確認了這個</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">假冒超人力霸王的存在</font></font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:19:25,968 --> 00:19:28,304
<font color="white">進次郎說的話果然沒錯</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:19:28,387 --> 00:19:30,931
<font color="white">你還是一樣熱血過頭呢</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:19:31,015 --> 00:19:33,267
<font color="white">太郎先生，你從一開始就…</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:19:33,350 --> 00:19:34,977
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:19:35,060 --> 00:19:36,437
<font color="white">所以這身裝甲也是…</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:19:38,022 --> 00:19:39,607
<font color="white">我將一切都賭在你身上</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:19:40,691 --> 00:19:44,486
<font color="white">你們的目的是把超人力霸王</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">塑造成災難般的存在吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:19:45,613 --> 00:19:48,407
<font color="white">如此露骨地揭露我們的計謀</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:19:48,490 --> 00:19:50,659
<font color="white">會讓我想認真跟你打啊</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:19:51,911 --> 00:19:54,413
<font color="white">我不會再讓你們得逞了</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:19:55,331 --> 00:19:57,958
<font color="white">-要上了，進次郎！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好！</font></font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:20:34,828 --> 00:20:36,288
<font color="white">不能掉以輕心！</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:20:45,422 --> 00:20:47,675
<font color="white">-我說你們啊，這樣很危險！</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-抱歉</font></font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:21:22,918 --> 00:21:24,003
<font color="white">上吧</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:21:34,555 --> 00:21:35,639
<font color="white">進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:21:35,723 --> 00:21:38,350
<font color="white">你確實贏了賭注</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:21:38,434 --> 00:21:39,852
<font color="white">我就承認這點吧</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:21:39,935 --> 00:21:41,812
<font color="white">然後把自己當作誘餌</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:21:41,895 --> 00:21:45,816
<font color="white">證明同伴清白的行動也讓我陶醉</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:21:45,899 --> 00:21:47,234
<font color="white">但是呢…</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:21:49,653 --> 00:21:52,239
<font color="white">這場勝負是我們贏了</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:21:52,323 --> 00:21:54,450
<font color="white">雖然和原先計畫的順序不同</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:21:54,533 --> 00:21:57,328
<font color="white">但還是先把首要目標的你解決掉吧</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:21:57,411 --> 00:21:58,704
<font color="white">進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:21:58,787 --> 00:22:01,123
<font color="white">你可別恨我唷</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:22:05,294 --> 00:22:07,963
<font color="white">這是什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:22:17,473 --> 00:22:18,640
<font color="white">那是…</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:24:05,038 --> 00:24:08,125
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：郭芷彤</font><font color="white"></font>

